        486.0,
        675.0
      ],
      "source_type": "text",
      "source_sentence": "Poly(MPC) can be regard as a quite unique zwitter-type polyelectrolyte having the independence of intra- and intermolecular interaction of PMPC from the concentration of $\\mathrm { N a C l } . ^ { [ 2 6 ] }$",
      "evidence_id": "ev016"
