        900.0,
        743.0
      ],
      "source_type": "text",
      "source_sentence": "The contact angle of the poly(DMAEMA) brush was reduced from $5 6 ^ { \\circ }$to $3 6 ^ { \\circ }$by immersion in methyl iodide solution",
